# Registry & UI

Source: `packages/ui/src/`. Use `@/` imports — sync rewrites for shadcn output.

**Never edit** `packages/ui/src/components/ui/` (stock shadcn primitives). Own behavior lives under `components/dimah-s3/`, `hooks/`, and `lib/`. Refresh primitives with `pnpm --filter @dimah-s3/ui sync:shadcn` only.

Do not edit `registry/generated/dimah-s3-ui/`. Item manifests: `registry/items/components.ts` → `pnpm --filter @dimah-s3/registry build` (writes `apps/docs/public/r/` then formats the workspace).

Direction-safe styling is required (LTR default, RTL-ready): prefer logical utilities like `text-start/end`, `ms/me`, `ps/pe`, and `start/end` over physical `left/right`, `ml/mr`, `pl/pr`, and `text-left/right` unless physically side-locked behavior is intentional.

**Detail (Read):** [docs/agents/registry.md](docs/agents/registry.md).
